      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Tutorial:

    Behind you is a yellow closed book. If you click (tap on
    touchscreen devices) a menu will pop up with the book that you can read.


    At
    every room you will need to figure out a four digit code which you can enter
    on your right. Clicking on the keypad will bring up a screen where you can enter
    the code.


    Just as a hint for now, the code is four zeros.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
